- [Troubleshooting SSD decrease issues](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/ONTAPGuide/ssd-decrease-troubleshooting.md): Learn how to troubleshoot issues that might occur during SSD capacity decrease operations.
- [Can't join SVM to Active Directory](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/ONTAPGuide/cannot-join-svm-to-ad.md): Tips to help resolve issues that arise when trying to join a storage virtual machine (SVM) to an Active Directory.
- [Can't delete SVM or volume](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/ONTAPGuide/cannot-delete-svm.md): Fix a problem where you can't delete a storage virtual machine (SVM) or a volume.
- [Misconfigured volume](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/ONTAPGuide/misconfigured-volume.md): Learn how to troubleshoot FSx for ONTAP volumes that are in a misconfigured state.
- [Volume has insufficient storage](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/ONTAPGuide/low-volume-capacity.md): Fix the problem where an ONTAP volume has run out of storage capacity.
- [Failed volume backups](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/ONTAPGuide/backups-failing.md): Troubleshoot and resolve automatic daily backup failures for FSx for ONTAP volumes due to insufficient storage capacity, and learn mitigation strategies.
- [Recovering deleted volumes](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/ONTAPGuide/recovering-deleted-volumes.md): Learn about the ONTAP recovery queue.
- [Troubleshooting network issues](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/ONTAPGuide/network-issues.md): Diagnose and fix networking problems.
- [I/O errors and NFS lock reclaim failures](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/fsx/latest/ONTAPGuide/nfs-failover-issues.md): Resolve I/O errors and NFS lock reclaim failures during FSx for ONTAP failover events.


